The name of the sequel should be a hint. "Mr. Do" can be found in the
castle area. Play the "Mr. Do" theme on any enchanted instrument before
you lower the drawbridge, and it will appear at your feet. Two
warnings:
a) It's neutrally aligned, and will blast characters of other
alignments that try to pick it up, and
b) Creating it prevents the drawbridge from lowering. (But we all
know the alternate route, don't we?)
Good luck! Mr. Do is a great game, and well worth the 15 point drop
in intelligence it causes.

